isoparametric coordinates and gets no mpc; nodes 5 and 7 coincide with
element nodes and are tied. Records equal the Professional 02-08-2026 ones
[build_safe mpc_check].
)
echo -no
number_of_space_dimensions 2
materi_velocity
materi_stress
end_initia
